## Fixture: module that imports nothing (alya-lang/alya#112 follow-up).
##
## `doit` calls bare `join(...)`, which must resolve to the runtime
## builtin even when some *other* module (`modjoin.alya`, imported as
## `m` by the entry file) defines a same-bare function. Modules that
## never imported a name must never resolve it from another module's
## imports.

pub function doit(a) -> string
    return join(a, "/")
end
